The '''An Extremely Difficult Item For You To Find''' is a {{Special}} Item that was obtainable during [[A Honk and Seek Adventure]].

== Obtaining ==
Looking at a {{Item|Warden Art}} in an item frame on one's [[Private Island]] while consuming a {{Item|Fudge Mint Core}} after using the {{Item|Jerry Helmet}} until the following message appeared, gave the player {{Item|An Extremely Difficult Item For You To Find}}: {{Dialogue|&a&lTHINK! &fThink &eJerry&f, THINK!}}

== Trivia ==
* Several hints were given ahead of time on how to obtain this item. They were as follows:
# This item can be found using other items.
# This item can be found using other Honk and Seek items.
# This item can only be found on your Private Island.

